From 30beaa5f9e543782fda851acdd3835de9a52dea7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Mr.Simi" <mr.simi@MrSimideMacBook-Air-5.local>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 02:05:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] fix(localb): scope production identity keychains to the
 managed file store

The login-Keychain default bound private-key items to the code signature
of whichever ad-hoc build created them; every re-signed build was then
refused by CSSMERR_CSP_OPERATION_AUTH_DENIED on SecKeyCopyPublicKey,
surfacing as transportIdentityMismatch (LOCALBStatus error 59) and
blocking real-domain startup. Both the transport identity and the
production signer now default to a 0600 file keychain under the managed
root (isolated SIMIGO_HOME first, <home>/.simigo/localb second). Root
cause and probe evidence: ROOT_CAUSE_REALDOMAIN_START_FAILURE.md.
---
 .../LOCALBCore/LOCALBProductionSigner.swift   |  2 +-
 .../LOCALBTransportIdentityStore.swift        | 63 ++++++++++++++++---
 .../LOCALBTransportIdentityStoreTests.swift   | 26 +++++---
 3 files changed, 73 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Packages/LOCALBCore/Sources/LOCALBCore/LOCALBProductionSigner.swift b/Packages/LOCALBCore/Sources/LOCALBCore/LOCALBProductionSigner.swift
